  "description": "“I will absolutely reach the top in this brutal game and make a glorious return.” Dan Yun — once a top‑tier professional gamer, forcibly retired under suspicion of match‑fixing. Barely dragging himself through each day, a strange window suddenly appears before him: (Four Star Masters have entered.) (‘Doomsday Tutorial’ begins.) (Failure Penalty: Death) Given one more chance despite being consumed by his past, Dan Yun becomes a participant in “Blackout” — a game played for the amusement of the Constellations.series. Can he truly claim the top spot once again?\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6354873) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=849923), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14009916)",
